{"title":"我们工人爱《创业》(新风俗画)","authors":[],"dates":[{"year":1976,"month":12,"day":5}],"is_range_date":false,"parts":[{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"“四人帮”就是藏着黑心肝的人……"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"努力为社会主义创大业"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周挺杉说国家要有民气，队伍要有士气，人要有志气。我们要为毛主席、华主席争气!"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"丁兆庆,潘文辉"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"抱个“大金娃娃”来报喜"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"丁兆庆　潘文辉"}],"comments":[],"origin":"","comment_pivots":[],"description":"","page_start":1,"page_end":1,"alias":""}